a buffer called 'the closing entry' is environment's "TERM".
If 'the closing entry's size is not 'the first reading in bytes''s size then, Print "ASSERT ENV-06: expected {'the first reading in bytes''s size} got {'the closing entry's size}", Exit 95. Print 'the closing entry's size.
If 'the closing entry's empty is not 'the first reading in bytes''s empty then, Print "ASSERT ENV-06: expected {'the first reading in bytes''s empty} got {'the closing entry's empty}", Exit 95. Print 'the closing entry's empty.
a value called 'the placard' is environment's "TERM".
If 'the placard' is not 'the first reading' then, Print "ASSERT ENV-06: expected the text got a different value", Exit 95. Print 'the first reading in bytes''s empty.
Print 'the closing entry's size.

